msgid ""
"{name} has a new interface, starting mid January 2022. You should still be "
"able to do everything you did before, though you will probably get to each "
"function a bit differently —hopefully more intuitively.\n"
"Tasks are organized into Data Collection and Analysis, and you can switch "
"between them with the button in the upper right of the main {name} window.\n"
"Either window allows you to run reports."
msgstr ""

#: /home/kentr/bin/AZT/azt/frontend/ui_shell.py:78
